<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on BCI.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on BCI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 70 million American-style call warrants, on Banca Commerciale Italiana SpA, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    4,000.00 ITL	    ISSUE PRICE  422.50 ITL</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	14.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3,741.00 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
